==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Doge Darks should be your money source. Kill them and try to time in your [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] to chip Dark Emperor Satan's health down. If you don't have Cats in a Box, [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] are your best alternatives. If you have [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|Wrestling Cat]], she can also help make this stage a lot easier.

As a side note, make sure to kill the peons with the [[Cat Cannon]] before sending out your Awakened Bahamut. Otherwise, you would risk him being perma-frozen to death.

